        "text_diaEbf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Your neck isn't going to feel better by waiting.</p><p>Give yourself 10 minutes a day to reset, relax and get back to what you enjoy.</p><p>Try QUESTPROPS™ at home, completely risk-free.</p><p>180-Day Risk-Free Trial<br/>2-Year Warranty<br/> Complimentary Shipping & Returns</p>",
